      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>Discussed on Dec 7th call...need to figure out why the second form doesn't work with 3.4.  Note, however, that it's not going to work when datastream mediation is enabled in any case, because the relative URI won't resolve (the URL back to Fedora to get the content is very temporary).  </p>",
