      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/ddfaabcc9635974ebed182e89941a947?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FSB-2.png",
       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/ddfaabcc9635974ebed182e89941a947?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FSB-2.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/ddfaabcc9635974ebed182e89941a947?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FSB-2.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/ddfaabcc9635974ebed182e89941a947?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FSB-2.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Stephen Bayliss",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=6089a4cb543264006867626e",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>See also \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"FCREPO-706\" >\n                <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-706\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\"  title=\"Datastream bindings for methods passing as URL use old-style LITE API\" >\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10303?size=medium\" />\n            FCREPO-706\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Closed</span>\n            </span>\n.  If the URI resolver for \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"FCREPO-990\" >\n                <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-990\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\"  title=\"URIResolver for Saxon Servlet to allow for additional datastream bindings to be provided to xslt\" >\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10315?size=medium\" />\n            FCREPO-990\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Closed</span>\n            </span>\n were modified to generically handle relative HTTP URL paths, then the paths will actually change if we later implemented \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"FCREPO-706\" >\n                <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-706\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\"  title=\"Datastream bindings for methods passing as URL use old-style LITE API\" >\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10303?size=medium\" />\n            FCREPO-706\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Closed</span>\n            </span>\n ie moved from the LITE to the new REST API paths to datastreams.  So if we do fix this then \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"FCREPO-706\" >\n                <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-706\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\"  title=\"Datastream bindings for methods passing as URL use old-style LITE API\" >\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10303?size=medium\" />\n            FCREPO-706\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Closed</span>\n            </span>\n should be implemented first to avoid changing behaviour.  (unless we implemented some specific behaviour if the HTTP URL path was for Fedora).</p>",
     "created": "08/Sep/11 8:36 AM",
     "id": "12047",
     "jsdPublic": true,
     "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/10767/comment/12047",
